Requirements
============

To compile Qupil you need following libs: 

Linux:
- Qt version >= 5.0 --> https://www.qt.io/
- Qt Multimedia (part of the selected Qt installation)

Basic Installation
==================

Linux:

  1. Type "cd path/to/the/sources". Then do for example "qmake qupil.pro" to configure the makefile for your system.

  2. Type "make" to compile the package.

  3. Become root (typing "su") and type "make install" to install the program binary.

Database support uses Qt SQL with the QSQLITE driver shipped with Qt; no direct sqlite3 development package is required by Qupil.
